# content/beauty/looks/cool.cygrade — the beauty shot's cool look: a slightly cool white balance
# from the parametric controls, then an exported-style `.cube` (cool.cube, sRGB-encoded) that pushes
# the shadows teal and the highlights toward steel. The two are baked into ONE table, so the frame
# still pays one lookup.
cygrade 1
name Cool
temperature 7400
contrast 1.02
cube cool.cube
cube-encoding srgb
